The '''Bronze Candy''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player who finished '''3rd''' on the [[Christmas Event 2017]] Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Bronze Candy has the same appearance as [[Candy]], but replacing the red color with a bronze coloring.

== Trivia ==
*During the event, players collected as many [[Snow Tokens|Winter Tokens]] (acts exactly like [[coins]] but Christmas-exclusive) as they could and would score points which would determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Blue Candy]], [[Silver Candy]], and [[Gold Candy]].
**The trophy reskins were awarded 2 years after the original [[Candy]] was added to the game.
*This item is a bronze reskin of [[Candy]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife from 2015.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this weapon is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/110620992/profile x808z]'''.

